\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus! Redeemer, Saviour, Lord,
\par The weary sinner's Friend,
\par Come to my help, pronounce the word,
\par And bid my troubles end.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Deliverance to my soul proclaim,
\par And life, and liberty;
\par Shed forth the virtue of Thy name,
\par And Jesus prove  to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Faith to be healed Thou know'st I have,
\par For Thou that faith hast given;
\par Thou canst, Thou wilt the sinner save,
\par And make me meet for heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou canst o'ercome this heart of mine,
\par Thou wilt victorious prove;
\par For everlasting strength is Thine,
\par And everlasting love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thy powerful Spirit shall  subdue 
\par Unconquerable sin,
\par Cleanse this foul heart, and make
\par it new,
\par And write Thy law within.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Bound down with twice ten 
\par thousand ties,
\par Yet let me hear Thy call,
\par My soul in confidence shall rise,
\par Shall rise and break  through all.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

